source('S09','Romania’s Treasury — guarded by the Russian “ally”','Viorica Moisuc, Minerva','2022-02','English','Scholarly article / translated documents','Full PDF obtained; relevant passages read','https://editurafrm.ro/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/2-MOISUC.pdf','Vol. 2, issue 1, pp. 27–76; especially pp. 72–74 and notes 96–103','Reproduces a translated 13 December 1924 report describing 1919 relocations and subsequent overseas disposal of specified coin groups.','The URL’s 2024 upload date is not the publication date. Strongly polemical framing; translations are mediated through Schipor. The reproduced report contains an ambiguous numerical expression.','Schipor archival reconstruction')
source('S10','Судьба «румынского золота» в России 1916–2020. Очерки истории','Tatyana A. Pokivaylova, Aletheia / Institute of Slavic Studies RAS','2021','Russian','Book','Full 268-page PDF obtained; relevant chapters read','https://inslav.ru/sites/default/files/editions/2021pokivaylova.pdf','ISBN 978-5-00165-289-2; pp. 119–132, 143–167, 199–228, 243–253','Russian archival synthesis acknowledges gold still recorded in 1922 and described as обезличено by 1924; discusses inventories, returns and competing debt claims.','Some eastward routes are explicitly speculative. Two conflicting 1922 balances are quoted. “Depersonalized” does not by itself prove melting. Archive-access statements describe conditions when the book was written.','Pokivaylova / Russian historiography')
source('S11','Amintiri — including Jurnalul de la Moscova','Alexandru Lapedatu; edited by Ioan Opriș','1998 edition; diary 1917','Romanian','Published eyewitness diary','Full volume obtained; Moscow diary passages read','https://www.memorialsighet.ro/wp-content/uploads/2016/02/alapedatu_amintiri_opris_secured.pdf','Printed pp. 117–121, 129–130, 142, 151, 155–158; PDF page = printed page + 4','Day-by-day account of packing, departure, observed railway stops, damp storage, later relocation, and proposed evacuation to America.','Published transcription, not the handwritten notebook inspected. Lapedatu supervised cultural consignments, not an audit of all bullion. Download is for personal reading; this site does not redistribute the book.','Lapedatu eyewitness')
