source('S19','British Adventurers and Revolutionary Russia’s War over Bessarabia','Geoffrey Swain, Revolutionary Russia','2021-11-30','English','Scholarly article','Full open-access PDF obtained; relevant passages read','https://eprints.gla.ac.uk/257366/1/257366.pdf','34:2, pp. 219–238; DOI 10.1080/09546545.2021.1996320; notes 8, 42, 44','Locates Boyle material in PRONI D1943 and British diplomatic papers; retells a jewels claim through George Hill’s memoir.','Its introductory shipment summary repeats problematic quantities. A memoir-derived jewel story is not a BNR gold recovery manifest.','Boyle historiography')
